Package: ArcHellinger
Type: Package
Title: Arc-Hellinger Normalization for Sparse Compositional Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Yiqian",
        family = "Zhang",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "92595307+yiqianomics@users.noreply.github.com"
    )
Description: Provides Hellinger-Riemann intrinsic coordinates and
    Simplex Hellinger alpha and beta diversity summaries for sparse
    compositional data on the closed simplex. The methods use square-root
    compositions and angular calibration, allowing exact zeros without
    pseudo-count replacement.
